Package: taxmill
Title: Turn PDF Financial Statements into a Tidy Dataset
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Madsen", email = "danielmadsen@live.dk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A mill for digital PDF financial statements: extract the text,
    shape the statement into the simple line format the parser expects, and
    export every file at once to Excel in tidy form. Tax accounts and
    ordinary annual accounts are laid out as tables, and that structure is
    what makes the route possible at all. Everything runs locally and
    nothing is uploaded, so the documents -- which are usually confidential
    -- never leave the machine. The shaping step in the middle is manual and
    slow, and the package is built to make the rest of it fast and to catch
    every mistake before anything is written.
